<title>COLOMBIA: Q1 net soars at Carton de Colombia.</title>
<headline>Q1 net soars at Carton de Colombia.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter net profit at Carton de Colombia jumped to 2.57 billion pesos from 1.05 billion pesos in the same period last year, the Securities Superintendency said.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the packing company's sharp run-up in profitability, but said its net assets rose to 535.9 billion pesos from 507.5 in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
